This standalone implementation was developed from TAgent's own event-model
and task-instance trace design. Design references in the source workspace:

- packages/tagent-core/src/protocol.ts
- packages/tagent-core/src/workflow-history.ts
- packages/tagent-server/src/workflow-catalog.ts
- packages/tagent-server/src/workflow-index.ts
- packages/tagent-server/src/workflow-events.ts
- packages/tagent-web/src/app/WorkflowDrawer.logic.ts

This package does not import those modules, bundle TAgent services or include
third-party code. Framework-specific UI, storage adapters and runtime execution
were not extracted. Built-in Node.js APIs are used normally as runtime APIs.

Fixtures are newly authored synthetic logs. No credentials, private traces,
user conversations, application settings or paid provider output are included.

